ParentVault_cancelWithdraw
├── when the contract is paused
│   └── it should revert with EnforcedPause
├── when the epoch is not open
│   └── it should revert with ParentVault__EpochNotOpen
├── when caller has no withdraw
│   └── it should revert with ParentVault__NoWithdraw
└── when the cancel withdraw is valid
    ├── it should transfer shares from the vault to the withdrawer
    ├── it should delete the withdrawer's withdraw mapping
    ├── it should update the epoch total share burn amount
    └── it should emit WithdrawCancelled
